Pokémon Showdown
----------------
https://github.com/smogon/pokemon-showdown

The fast engine (src/battle.rs and the modules it uses) reimplements Pokémon
Showdown's battle rules for this format and is checked against Showdown commit
56bc083aa (2026-10-17). The exact reference engine (src/sim/) is a port of
Showdown's simulator (event system, action queue, handlers, PRNG) at commit
9fb3a5b99 (2026-10-03). data/dex.json and data/effects.json are exported from
Showdown's dex for the format (tools/export_dex.js, tools/export_effects.js),
including the Champions mod. data/damage_cases_sample.json holds damage numbers
computed by Showdown (tools/damage_oracle.js). The pools/Teams_cov teams were
generated from Showdown's dex and validated by its team validator
(tools/coverage_pool.js). Showdown itself is not part of this repository; the
verification tools run against a local checkout. Its license:

