battler
-------
https://github.com/jackson-nestelroad/battler

battler's effect scripts were read as a description of some effects during
development. No code was copied from it.

Tournament teams
----------------
During development the engine was also tested on publicly shared tournament
teams from the VGC Pastes repository (https://x.com/VGCPastes) and Limitless
(https://limitlessvgc.com). Those teams are not included in this repository.

